{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-monkey-simian-army","title":"Chaos Monkey 与 Simian Army","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/chaos-monkey-simian-army","wordCount":875,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"chaos-monkey-与-simian-army\">Chaos Monkey 与 Simian Army</h1><p>Netflix 的 <strong>Simian Army</strong> 是混沌工程工具的鼻祖——一个以&quot;猴子&quot;命名的工具家族，每个&quot;猴子&quot;针对不同类型的故障注入。虽然 Netflix 内部工具不全是开源的，但它们定义的混沌工程理念和工具分类影响了整个行业。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>注入目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Chaos Monkey</td>\n<td>随机终止生产实例</td>\n<td>EC2 实例/容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chaos Gorilla</td>\n<td>模拟整个可用区故障</td>\n<td>AWS AZ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chaos Kong</td>\n<td>模拟整个区域故障</td>\n<td>AWS Region</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Latency Monkey</td>\n<td>注入网络延迟</td>\n<td>服务间调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conformity Monkey</td>\n<td>检测不符合最佳实践的实例</td>\n<td>配置合规性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Security Monkey</td>\n<td>检测安全配置问题</td>\n<td>安全漏洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Doctor Monkey</td>\n<td>检测实例健康状况</td>\n<td>应用健康</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"chaos-monkey-工作原理\">Chaos Monkey 工作原理</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    CM[Chaos Monkey 调度器\\n每天随机时间触发] --&gt; SELECT[随机选择目标\\n按配置的终止比例]&#10;    SELECT --&gt; CHECK{在白名单内?\\n且在允许时间窗口?}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|是| KILL[终止目标实例]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|否| SKIP[跳过]&#10;    KILL --&gt; MONITOR[监控稳态指标\\n自动恢复或告警]\">flowchart LR\n    CM[Chaos Monkey 调度器\\n每天随机时间触发] --&gt; SELECT[随机选择目标\\n按配置的终止比例]\n    SELECT --&gt; CHECK{在白名单内?\\n且在允许时间窗口?}\n    CHECK --&gt;|是| KILL[终止目标实例]\n    CHECK --&gt;|否| SKIP[跳过]\n    KILL --&gt; MONITOR[监控稳态指标\\n自动恢复或告警]</pre><p><strong>Chaos Monkey 配置（Netflix OSS 版本）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# simianarmy/chaos.properties&#10;simianarmy.chaos.enabled=true&#10;simianarmy.chaos.leashed=false        # false=真实执行，true=只记录不执行&#10;&#10;# 允许执行的时间窗口（工作日 9:00-15:00）&#10;simianarmy.chaos.ASG.enabled=true&#10;simianarmy.chaos.ASG.probability=0.1  # 10% 概率终止实例&#10;&#10;# 白名单/黑名单&#10;simianarmy.chaos.ASG.skipTag=chaos_monkey_exempt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># simianarmy/chaos.properties</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">simianarmy.chaos.enabled=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">simianarmy.chaos.leashed=false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # false=真实执行，true=只记录不执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 允许执行的时间窗口（工作日 9:00-15:00）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">simianarmy.chaos.ASG.enabled=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">simianarmy.chaos.ASG.probability=0.1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 10% 概率终止实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 白名单/黑名单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">simianarmy.chaos.ASG.skipTag=chaos_monkey_exempt</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"开源-chaos-monkey-for-spring-boot\">开源 Chaos Monkey for Spring Boot</h2><p>Netflix 未直接开源原版 Chaos Monkey，但 Codecentric 提供了 Spring Boot 版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- pom.xml --&gt;&#10;&lt;dependency&gt;&#10;    &lt;groupId&gt;de.codecentric&lt;/groupId&gt;&#10;    &lt;artifactId&gt;chaos-monkey-spring-boot&lt;/artifactId&gt;&#10;    &lt;version&gt;3.1.0&lt;/version&gt;&#10;&lt;/dependency&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- pom.xml --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groupId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>de.codecentric&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groupId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>chaos-monkey-spring-boot&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>3.1.0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# application.yaml&#10;chaos:&#10;  monkey:&#10;    enabled: true&#10;    assaults:&#10;      level: 5 # 每 N 个请求注入一次故障&#10;      latencyActive: true&#10;      latencyRangeStart: 100&#10;      latencyRangeEnd: 500&#10;      exceptionsActive: true&#10;      killApplicationActive: false&#10;    watcher:&#10;      service: true&#10;      restController: true&#10;      repository: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># application.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">chaos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  monkey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    assaults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每 N 个请求注入一次故障</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      latencyActive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      latencyRangeStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      latencyRangeEnd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exceptionsActive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      killApplicationActive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    watcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      restController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>通过 Actuator 动态控制</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 动态开启延迟注入&#10;curl -X POST localhost:8080/actuator/chaosmonkey/enable&#10;&#10;# 配置攻击参数&#10;curl -X POST localhost:8080/actuator/chaosmonkey/assaults \\&#10;  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\&#10;  -d &#39;{&quot;level&quot;: 3, &quot;latencyActive&quot;: true, &quot;latencyRangeStart&quot;: 200}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 动态开启延迟注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> localhost:8080/actuator/chaosmonkey/enable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 配置攻击参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> localhost:8080/actuator/chaosmonkey/assaults</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"level\": 3, \"latencyActive\": true, \"latencyRangeStart\": 200}'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"latency-monkey-网络延迟注入\">Latency Monkey：网络延迟注入</h2><p>Latency Monkey 验证服务对网络抖动的容忍度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延迟场景</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>验证点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>50ms 额外延迟</td>\n<td>所有服务</td>\n<td>超时配置合理性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200ms 额外延迟</td>\n<td>关键路径</td>\n<td>用户体验影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000ms 延迟</td>\n<td>非关键服务</td>\n<td>熔断器是否触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机延迟（100-1000ms）</td>\n<td>存储层</td>\n<td>缓存命中率变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"chaos-engineering-渐进采用路线\">Chaos Engineering 渐进采用路线</h2><p>Netflix 经验总结的混沌工程采用路线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S1[阶段 1\\n手动注入\\nStaging 环境\\n单实例] --&gt; S2&#10;    S2[阶段 2\\n手动注入\\n生产环境\\n单 AZ] --&gt; S3&#10;    S3[阶段 3\\n自动化\\n生产环境\\n随机时间] --&gt; S4&#10;    S4[阶段 4\\n持续混沌\\nChaos as Code\\n多 AZ/Region]\">flowchart TD\n    S1[阶段 1\\n手动注入\\nStaging 环境\\n单实例] --&gt; S2\n    S2[阶段 2\\n手动注入\\n生产环境\\n单 AZ] --&gt; S3\n    S3[阶段 3\\n自动化\\n生产环境\\n随机时间] --&gt; S4\n    S4[阶段 4\\n持续混沌\\nChaos as Code\\n多 AZ/Region]</pre><p>Netflix 达到阶段 4 花了约 4 年时间，大多数公司从阶段 1 开始，3-6 个月后进入阶段 2。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键实践清单\">关键实践清单</h2><ul>\n<li>首次部署 Chaos Monkey 时，将 <code>leashed=true</code>（只记录不执行）运行 2 周，了解将被影响的服务</li>\n<li>从非关键服务开始（推荐服务而非支付服务）</li>\n<li>确保所有服务有 Kubernetes Deployment 或 Auto Scaling Group（而非单实例）</li>\n<li>与<a href=\"../experiments/experiment-design\">实验场景设计方法</a>结合，为每次 Chaos Monkey 执行定义明确的假说</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"局限与现代演进\">局限与现代演进</h2><p>Simian Army 诞生于虚拟机时代，故障注入以&quot;终止实例&quot;为主，粒度粗、影响面大。随着 Kubernetes 与微服务架构普及，云原生混沌工具在几个方向上做了细化和演进：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Simian Army</th>\n<th>云原生混沌工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>注入粒度</td>\n<td>实例、可用区整体</td>\n<td>Pod、容器、单个依赖调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障类型</td>\n<td>终止、延迟、合规检查</td>\n<td>网络丢包/延迟/分区、DNS 故障、资源压力、HTTP 注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编排方式</td>\n<td>定时随机触发</td>\n<td>声明式 Experiment/Workflow，可版本化、可复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳态校验</td>\n<td>依赖外部监控</td>\n<td>内置探针与自动中止（不满足稳态假说即停止实验）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行环境</td>\n<td>主要面向生产</td>\n<td>支持 Staging 到生产的渐进式推进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要澄清的是：Simian Army 的核心思想——<strong>在生产环境持续、随机地注入真实故障，用受控的失败换取系统韧性</strong>——并未过时，只是被更细粒度、更可编排的工具继承。它留下的两个关键约束至今仍是准则：一是故障必须真实发生在生产，二是每次注入都要有可观测的稳态指标作为对照，否则注入只是制造事故。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Simian Army 定义了混沌工程工具的原型：自动化、随机、生产环境、配置驱动。核心理念是让故障注入成为常态而非例外，通过持续的小故障训练出能抵御大故障的系统。Kubernetes 时代的混沌工具见<a href=\"litmus-chaos-mesh\">Litmus 与 Chaos Mesh</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Chaos Monkey 与 Simian Army","id":"chaos-monkey-与-simian-army"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Chaos Monkey 工作原理","id":"chaos-monkey-工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"开源 Chaos Monkey for Spring Boot","id":"开源-chaos-monkey-for-spring-boot"},{"level":2,"text":"Latency Monkey：网络延迟注入","id":"latency-monkey-网络延迟注入"},{"level":2,"text":"Chaos Engineering 渐进采用路线","id":"chaos-engineering-渐进采用路线"},{"level":2,"text":"关键实践清单","id":"关键实践清单"},{"level":2,"text":"局限与现代演进","id":"局限与现代演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GameDay 演练组织与故障响应剧本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/gameday-runbooks"},"next":{"title":"Litmus 与 Chaos Mesh：Kubernetes 原生混沌平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/litmus-chaos-mesh"}}